{% set already_taken_actions = already_taken_actions or [] %}

{# health_check — one read-only audit of the live configuration and compiled behavior. Detection
   layers: a deterministic CRITICAL floor over the real gathered values (residue, silent greeting,
   missing availability artifact, language conflict — reproducible, never flicker run-to-run),
   pass-1 structured_generation over the full gather (anchored trigger table, closed `rule` enum —
   owns the loose/semantic call-breakers and all judgment-bound WARNING/INFO), a deterministic
   allowed-values check in the gather, and a focused pass-2 forcing a per-entry verdict for every
   contract-carrying setting. Auth-header secrets are masked to length stubs before any value
   reaches a model or a log. Findings merge (the floor wins its (idn, rule), pass-1 adds the rest),
   pass a measured suppression/demote post-pass, and render CRITICAL → WARNING → INFO back to main(). #}

